    "Stripe server-owned idempotency header and attempt metadata; stable API request identity and safe owner-only status/HTTP409 hold reference",
    "Captured funding state and callback raw evidence survive checkout projection; checkout responses never authorize a wallet credit",
    "Read-only Part52 original snapshot replay; no historical attempt enrollment or public resend/reconciliation endpoint"
